# Conformance probe pack whose inner pack has two kinds that both qualify by
# requires (spec 0.34, Encode and Conversion), most significant bit first.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   byte 0      n
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-twokinds message
format     conformance-inner-pick
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.n  8  uint
inner   conformance-inner-twokinds
